      "message": "Based on our conversations, I defined this to take a reference to the buffers and left resource tracking to the caller (e.g. a BufferManager) that creates this task.\n\nThis is currently at odds with some of the other CommandBuffer functions that operate on buffers though they are not entirely consistent about this either (e.g. `copyTextureToBuffer` and `copyBufferToBuffer` take `sk_sp\u003cBuffer\u003e` but `copyBufferToTexture` takes a `const Buffer*`.",
