      "writtenOn": "2023-01-10T14:40:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "BufferProxy might be up in the air, but if we don\u0027t end up with buffer proxies, I think `const Buffer*` makes sense in this case, since the Buffer for compute is possibly cleared many times in a Recording between render encoders, so it only has to be ref\u0027ed by the recording once. Assuming there ends up being a good spot to consolidate those ownership tracking (since this is outside the BufferManager, which was doing it for other buffers), we can hopefully do a consistency pass over all the tasks to settle on one way of doing things.",
